      "comment": "LITTLE BONT (1) turned in a moderate run last time when eighth at Horsham over 485m behind Giacomo (27.81) in a Grade 4/5. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Has ability and can bounce back. ASTON SUNSHINE (6) was a last start winner (22.25) at this track who is building a strong winning record. Has never been out of the money in three starts this course. Must be included in calculations. PAW WONDER (3) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing seventh (26.23) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 NP. Can turn it around this time. TROPIC SANDS (2) is worth including after a top-three finish most recently.",
